WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.350
- I'm kinda finding it hard
to gather thoughts right now

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.458
because if you haven't noticed

00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:04.979
there's a (bleep) snake on my face.

00:00:05.849 --> 00:00:10.671
(energetic rock music)

00:00:15.671 --> 00:00:16.539
- What are we doing today?

00:00:16.539 --> 00:00:18.939
- We're getting snakes on us.

00:00:18.939 --> 00:00:20.434
- I don't know why you're
so excited about it.

00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:23.392
- We are going to try
massage therapy with snakes.

00:00:23.392 --> 00:00:24.803
- I read on the internet about

00:00:24.803 --> 00:00:26.714
this thing called snake massages.

00:00:26.714 --> 00:00:28.615
- This man looks so happy!

00:00:28.615 --> 00:00:30.281
- I can't imagine that's
what I'm going to be like.

00:00:30.281 --> 00:00:32.096
- Why am I doing this again?

00:00:32.096 --> 00:00:34.360
- [Ned] Esquire Network's
Team Ninja Warrior

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.129
challenged the Test Friends
to do something extreme,

00:00:37.129 --> 00:00:40.366
so I'm bringing in a 12 foot python.

00:00:40.366 --> 00:00:41.360
- Are you sweating?

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.306
- Yeah, I'm sweaty! My palms are sweating.

00:00:43.306 --> 00:00:44.706
This is a normal human reaction.

00:00:44.706 --> 00:00:46.206
- Why do you think people
are afraid of snakes?

00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:46.989
- They bite,

00:00:46.989 --> 00:00:48.804
but snakes are actually really docile

00:00:48.804 --> 00:00:49.989
if you take care of them properly.

00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:51.353
- Ugh!

00:00:51.353 --> 00:00:54.682
- All right, so this is Casper,
and he's a ghost corn snake.

00:00:54.682 --> 00:00:55.921
- Oh, he's adorable!

00:00:55.921 --> 00:00:57.388
- This is Stanley the ball python,

00:00:57.388 --> 00:00:59.563
and this is Swazi the ball python.

00:00:59.563 --> 00:01:01.468
Any you wanna hold first?

00:01:01.468 --> 00:01:02.361
- Uhh, I'll wait.

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:04.105
- What's a good way to hold him-- Okay!

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:05.015
Okay!

00:01:05.015 --> 00:01:07.654
- Wow, look at his eyes!

00:01:07.654 --> 00:01:09.452
- Hello, you're so scaley!

00:01:09.452 --> 00:01:10.610
- I've like, never felt an animal

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:11.770
that feels like this before.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:13.841
- He's a constrictor
so he likes to squeeze.

00:01:13.841 --> 00:01:15.446
- Squeeze out the pain, Casper!

00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:17.348
- It's Desha, bitch! (laughs)

00:01:17.348 --> 00:01:20.656
- [Maycie] I'm gonna throw
up, or cry, or something,

00:01:20.656 --> 00:01:22.049
I don't even know.

00:01:22.049 --> 00:01:24.229
- I'm okay with the
snakes being on my back;

00:01:24.229 --> 00:01:27.491
I would prefer not to
have snakes on my boobs.

00:01:27.491 --> 00:01:29.256
- I'm gonna get the snakes on my chest.

00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:31.070
I think it'll be like getting a hug.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:32.852
- Let's (bleep) do this!
It's gonna be dope!

00:01:32.852 --> 00:01:34.125
Probably, hopefully.

00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:35.983
Okay, okay!
- [Maycie] Oh my god.

00:01:35.983 --> 00:01:37.013
- [Jen] Okay!

00:01:39.633 --> 00:01:40.557
- Mmkay.

00:01:40.557 --> 00:01:42.431
- [Jen] This is not a sensation that I

00:01:42.431 --> 00:01:44.442
have experienced before today.

00:01:44.442 --> 00:01:46.047
- [Maycie] Oh my god, it's
going right by her face.

00:01:46.047 --> 00:01:47.144
- [Jen] Doesn't smell bad.

00:01:47.144 --> 00:01:48.099
I'll say that.

00:01:48.099 --> 00:01:49.923
Feels kinda good, Maycie.

00:01:49.923 --> 00:01:50.781
- I'm just chillin'.

00:01:50.781 --> 00:01:52.808
I could actually, like, fall
asleep with these on me.

00:01:52.808 --> 00:01:53.505
- [Jen] You know what?

00:01:53.505 --> 00:01:56.064
They kinda feel like thin, long ice packs

00:01:56.064 --> 00:01:57.858
just moving across my body.

00:01:57.858 --> 00:01:59.112
- Buenos dias.

00:01:59.112 --> 00:02:01.468
- If I shut my eyes,
I do sort of doze off.

00:02:01.468 --> 00:02:02.989
It is very relaxing.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:06.254
- There's just something
about watching a snake move

00:02:06.254 --> 00:02:07.624
that kinda makes me nauseous.

00:02:07.624 --> 00:02:08.680
- They're just like, kneading dough.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:10.788
They were kneading the
muscles on my chest.

00:02:10.788 --> 00:02:13.165
Ready?

00:02:13.165 --> 00:02:13.648
- Yeah.

00:02:13.648 --> 00:02:15.565
I guess I won't half-ass it.

00:02:15.565 --> 00:02:19.144
I'll put the snakes on my face.

00:02:19.144 --> 00:02:19.878
So (bleep) weird.

00:02:19.878 --> 00:02:22.772
- I want a snake scalp massage.

00:02:22.772 --> 00:02:23.869
And I want it now.

00:02:23.869 --> 00:02:25.645
- Please take off your shirt. And--

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.331
- Wait, what? Are you serious?

00:02:27.331 --> 00:02:29.140
- I'm just goin' off the brochure, here.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.867
- [Desha] Don't act
like you don't like it!

00:02:30.867 --> 00:02:32.797
- You ever seen a head more
ready to get a snake put on it?

00:02:32.797 --> 00:02:34.267
- Alright, let's do this!

00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:35.588
Here comes Casper.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:36.738
- Okie dokie...

00:02:36.738 --> 00:02:38.207
- My old pal.

00:02:40.558 --> 00:02:43.111
- Yup, there's one!

00:02:43.111 --> 00:02:44.901
- I'm getting goosebumps!

00:02:44.901 --> 00:02:48.943
- Let's just, let's just
put the snake, okay.

00:02:48.943 --> 00:02:50.221
Yep, yep.

00:02:50.221 --> 00:02:53.412
Okay, he's on my face.

00:02:53.412 --> 00:02:56.608
- I can hear him breathing!

00:02:56.608 --> 00:02:58.332
Awww!

00:02:58.332 --> 00:02:59.757
This is the best.

00:02:59.757 --> 00:03:02.828
- Forgive me if I'm not the
most articulate, right now.

00:03:02.828 --> 00:03:05.223
Holy (bleep), he's going
across my eyeballs.

00:03:05.223 --> 00:03:06.564
- You know, sometimes you hear people

00:03:06.564 --> 00:03:10.193
breathing in your ear,
but very rarely a snake.

00:03:10.193 --> 00:03:12.386
- What is the point of this, again?

00:03:12.386 --> 00:03:13.553
What are the benefits?

00:03:13.553 --> 00:03:15.234
- I'm proud of you, Bergara!

00:03:18.603 --> 00:03:19.711
- It's working, so far.

00:03:19.711 --> 00:03:23.020
- It genuinely feels like
this amazing massage.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.683
- [Ryan] He is just going to
town, right on the old package!

00:03:25.683 --> 00:03:27.735
(laughs)

00:03:27.735 --> 00:03:30.363
- Ohhh, I can feel his tongue
on the back of my neck.

00:03:30.363 --> 00:03:32.647
- I could've done that for
like, four or five more hours.

00:03:32.647 --> 00:03:35.312
- So I was already really
really nervous and freaking out.

00:03:35.312 --> 00:03:36.448
Oh my god, I'm freaking out!

00:03:36.448 --> 00:03:39.128
And then I'm laying there
on the table, head-down,

00:03:39.128 --> 00:03:42.156
Ned tells me to turn around and
see the snake coming for me.

00:03:42.156 --> 00:03:45.025
And it is enormous.

00:03:45.025 --> 00:03:46.442
Uhh, wait, is it a big one?

00:03:46.442 --> 00:03:47.767
Oh my god, Oh my god!

00:03:47.767 --> 00:03:48.993
No, no, no! (laughs)

00:03:48.993 --> 00:03:51.594
Like, the biggest snake
I've ever even dreamed up.

00:03:51.594 --> 00:03:55.271
- So this is Big Worm,
probably about 12ish feet long?

00:03:55.271 --> 00:03:56.463
And he's 50 pounds.

00:03:56.463 --> 00:03:58.423
- And I did not sign up for that, at all.

00:03:58.423 --> 00:03:59.638
I thought they were little snakes.

00:03:59.638 --> 00:04:02.094
It was not going to be a big deal.

00:04:02.094 --> 00:04:06.080
Ugh, even thinking about it
now just really freaks me out.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.644
Ohh! I'm sorry, okay.

00:04:08.644 --> 00:04:11.721
Oh god, oh god oh god oh god.

00:04:11.721 --> 00:04:14.211
(screams)

00:04:14.211 --> 00:04:17.680
Sorry, I'm so scared.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.649
Ahh! Oh my god.

00:04:24.099 --> 00:04:26.828
I'm sorry, you guys!

00:04:26.828 --> 00:04:28.657
Oh, where's its head?

00:04:30.135 --> 00:04:31.786
- Okay, okay... I don't know,

00:04:34.611 --> 00:04:38.129
I was freaking out the entire
time, I never got used to it.

00:04:38.129 --> 00:04:39.892
But I'm proud of myself
that I accomplished it,

00:04:39.892 --> 00:04:42.095
and I did it, and I have it on video proof

00:04:42.095 --> 00:04:43.244
for the rest of my life.

00:04:43.244 --> 00:04:44.809
- I was really scared at first, but--

00:04:44.809 --> 00:04:46.348
- It was really relaxing!

00:04:46.348 --> 00:04:49.023
- I mean, as you can see,
I don't want to let him go.

00:04:49.023 --> 00:04:50.805
- Can I take this guy home, or...?

00:04:50.805 --> 00:04:51.534
- No.

00:04:51.534 --> 00:04:54.276
- I'm very proud of myself that I did it.

00:04:54.276 --> 00:04:55.984
- It did get more
relaxing towards the end.

00:04:55.984 --> 00:04:57.811
- It felt like a real massage.

00:04:57.811 --> 00:04:59.092
- You're not scared of snakes

00:04:59.092 --> 00:05:00.617
then totally go for it.

00:05:00.617 --> 00:05:02.853
- I dig them, I would
totally do this again.

00:05:02.853 --> 00:05:04.638
- I'll stick with humans.

00:05:04.638 --> 00:05:06.624
- [Ned] I'm gonna get a
taste of my own medicine.

00:05:06.624 --> 00:05:09.144
See what it's like.

00:05:09.144 --> 00:05:12.663
(screams)

00:05:12.663 --> 00:05:15.772
Ahhhh.

00:05:15.772 --> 00:05:17.011
Thanks for watching the Test Friends.

